 {"type":"pattern","classification":"tactical","recorded_at":"2026-09-03T21:10:58.136Z","evidence":{"seeds":"fabro-93f2","commit":"39abfb8c6096c7e4bf4045acb38a24660fa48dd0"},"name":"new-flag-without-helper-ripple","description":"When adding a new flag to gofib's options struct, avoid rippling the positional opts() test helper through ~40 call sites: add a small clone helper (stepOpts) that sets the new field, and only touch existing tests where defaults change (TestParseOptionsDefaults literal). run() must defensively clamp new stride-like fields to safe values because validation is skipped under -seed/-version.","files":["fib_test.go","main.go"],"id":"mx-7eaa5a"}
